  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-09-08T00:13:33.163Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "It should be possible to have wings on the quick menu but then they automatically turn off when going into the full menu, then coming back on when you go back to the quick menu. It clutters the menu up a lot and is too overwhelming for me and I don't want to have to manually turn them off and on when switching between menus.",
